{"parentUuid": "429ec108-299c-5f0f-8cba-3e1746117356", "isSidechain": false, "type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_synth_3cc7b8b6c80f478de36a", "type": "tool_result", "content": "1\t# ch-cap 练习题\n2\t\n3\t按顺序出，一次一题，答完点评再出下一题。\n4\t\n5\t1. C、A、P 各指什么？为什么\"三选二\"这个流行说法有误导性？实际的取舍发生在什么时刻？\n6\t2. PACELC 比 CAP 多说了什么？\n7\t3. 一个读多写少的配置中心，你选 CP 还是 AP？为什么？", "is_error": false}]}, "uuid": "768333de-60c5-5da4-b7f6-fce228fb9671", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T17:02:40.000Z", "userType": "external", "cwd": "{{WT}}", "sessionId": "3cef3f9e-010f-5d45-beef-4513b9e55d8c", "version": "2.1.215", "gitBranch": "HEAD", "sourceToolAssistantUUID": "429ec108-299c-5f0f-8cba-3e1746117356"}
